# Restaurant Sales Analysis – Q1 2023

## Project Overview

This project analyses restaurant sales data for the first quarter of 2023 (January–March) to uncover sales trends, identify top-performing menu items and understand customer purchasing patterns.

## Tools Used

- Microsoft Excel
- Microsoft Power BI

## Dataset

- Original records: 12,234
- Records retained: 12,097
- Menu items analysed: 32

## Key Findings

- Total revenue: 159,217.90
- Italian food generated the highest category revenue: 49,462.70.
- March recorded the highest monthly revenue: 54,610.60.
- Monday recorded the highest revenue among weekdays.
- Afternoon generated the highest revenue: 78,489.90.
- Korean Beef Bowl generated the highest revenue among menu items.

## Business Recommendations

- Maintain the quality and availability of popular Italian dishes.
- Promote high-performing items such as Korean Beef Bowl and Hamburger.
- Investigate lower Wednesday and morning sales.
- Monitor monthly sales trends to identify growth opportunities.

